{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/e26tXCCF1CGt5Oih0Y0dHg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:31.075755+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/e26tXCCF1CGt5Oih0Y0dHg","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/xYx5IQylooCgIZpibEmCV7XKTQk5zpicfeSnibl352HMXv9ICMNibgDfKNYCFicyehY80ZCohTlhBupvzQ96fJeVyicw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM6djdq6PtpII3eKUUDy3ibejyhyfykZMcO5HqHYaTr8U7jcV8kma87Y9gmFOV31R3QqgTZQVwbZTANEg4Wv2Ll9HPTe0wJePjdA4IBUsaEFw0Q/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>国家授时中心</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>“时间之旅”</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>科学夏令营</span></strong></span><strong><span>招募</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>0</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>6</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>/ </span></span><span><strong><span>时间之旅</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>等你来参与</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EfmhGG5LVkrWFyzaLNwbHEkdKdUibwUJPczheC3EY7NrH2hokUFPKcNib16EfwKk6qql50nvc1jThWHBGItLyd0mdfxVyicLfd52FfQxQveBmk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>为引导和激发大学生从事时间频率基础研究和应用研究的的兴趣，带领大家走进时间，领略时间科学的奥秘。中国科学院国家授时中心2026年“时间之旅”科学夏令营于</span></span><strong><span><span>2026年7月13日-17日</span></span></strong><span><span>在西安举办，接收营员</span></span><strong><span><span>50</span></span></strong><span><span>名左右。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EfmhGG5LVkr5Z8XvxfaNmoQ5UHMWd6aL5rST0c2ZvLl2wh366NP6Qq3m3vvEzBAdId8sxiblPT0EDpPriaXTlELRrcuUfYNdfpe7icsMZX1T1c/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>⑴具有良好的专业基础，热爱科研，有志愿推免或报考国家授时中心。</span></p><p><span>⑵物理、光学、电子、通信、导航定位、测试计量、计算机应用等相关专业优秀本科三年级学生（</span><strong><span>2027年7月毕业</span></strong><span>）。</span></p><p><span>⑶本科期间学习成绩优异，预计可获得所在高校推免资格，对科研工作有浓厚兴趣，并有较强或潜在的科研能力。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EfmhGG5LVko0JibxJImtOmoHZ9nqIfdcdVnVfYUdeLiahdVG9SXJvjhibG8iavvVibn552c8YfCNiad8AFJSUcQodoHs3IAoslvRMlia1tR24jCfA0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>登陆（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn）大学生夏令营报名，选择中国科学院国家授时中心“时间之旅”科学夏令营进行在线申请，并将填好的申请表及相关申请材料电子版（本科成绩单、已发表论文或出版物、英语四 /六级成绩单、各类奖励证书扫描件等）发到邮箱<span>ntsc2026@163.com</span>,邮件主题和附件名称统一为：姓名+本科学校+“时间之旅”夏令营。</span></p><p><span>我中心将根据申请人提供的材料信息进行遴选，入选营员名单将于2026年7月初通过“国家授时中心研究生教育”公众号上公布，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EfmhGG5LVkrIPtQTPrKqO686fgCrRibELnuCqMq3Q16bYlvBbXplmLVNrMGLQ7FZmeuP2XCIWIlIK4bX6nib0XlBXhfhoiahnl2UBkQXBrHIeo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>⑴夏令营期间，学生必须遵守我中心相关规定，严格按照营员安排进行工作与活动。</span></p><p><span>⑵凡参加夏令营的学生需准备5分钟PPT讲解（内容可包含自我介绍，本科期间获得的奖励及参与的重大课题等）。</span></p><p><span>⑶夏令营期间提供免费食宿，凭票报销营员来陕的单程路费（凭票实报实销至西安的火车硬座或硬卧或动车二等座，市内车费不予报销，具体报销规则另行通知）。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EfmhGG5LVkoYjajblicA0OqtgR54VTerZ2jFLzFZgUjb3WAjTwqiamibeFCPnwPevBxibHzdhxWcveoJD7a1B5ZDb4fKAMLrzibOg5ya4cOosaMY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span> 联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>单位网址：http://www.ntsc.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>单位地址：西安市临潼区书院东路3号</span></p><p><span>联系人：李老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：029-83890537</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xYx5IQylooCgIZpibEmCV7XKTQk5zpicfeAO0gE12aENGeRIrartcMryCPDCK3zBlRMOJQUWwBHSW6SX83hPibozA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>出品 | 国家授时中心学生会</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>海报 | 魏诗悦</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>排版 | 张睿</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>审核 | 李丹</span></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c2e9f4fe2693a6443da52b720a3441d316e0f7ae71be66eae7ca7be5e8a02eb2","textLength":790,"sourceSha256":"b4ec6c4c4e33e1af722039f86eee40b798803dde408f4655d490dc996d9655a8","selector":"#js_content","attachmen